                {"question": "What is AI generally good at in the content workflow?", "options": ["Perfectly replicating a specific brand voice with no editing", "Speeding up first-draft structure and brainstorming", "Verifying its own facts", "Replacing the need for a human editor entirely"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "AI tools are strong at quickly generating draft structures and idea lists, which a human then refines and verifies."}
