                {"question": "Why is it useful to notice what a campaign left OUT?", "options": ["It has no analytical value", "It reveals disciplined focus on the single most important message", "Ads are required to list everything", "It only matters for legal compliance"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "What a strong campaign chooses to omit often shows deliberate focus on its single most persuasive point."}
