                {"question": "Why does specificity (exact numbers, timeframes) strengthen a story in copy?", "options": ["It makes the copy longer, which is always better", "It builds credibility and makes the story feel real", "Specific numbers are required by advertising regulators", "It has no effect on believability"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Concrete, specific details make a story feel real and credible rather than generic or made up."},
